WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.503
Step 1. Open the referral page.

1.2
00:00:02.503 --> 00:00:08.963
You can set a referral to Pending, In progress, Completed, Cancelled, or Rejected.

2.1
00:00:08.963 --> 00:00:14.648
Step 2. Select the three-dot button at the right end of the patient's name bar.

2.2
00:00:14.648 --> 00:00:20.377
The menu has Edit referral, the statuses under Change status, and Copy link.

3.1
00:00:20.377 --> 00:00:24.269
Step 3. Under Change status, select Reject referral.

3.2
00:00:24.269 --> 00:00:27.841
The menu lists every status except the current one,

3.3
00:00:27.841 --> 00:00:32.053
and shows Cancel referral and Reject referral in red.

4.1
00:00:32.053 --> 00:00:36.370
Step 4. In the dialog, select Reject referral to confirm.

4.2
00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:41.651
Care shows Referral updated, and the referral shows the new status.
